src/mikemol/audiostruct/render.py|unplaced-gets-a-timestamp|return f"\*\*\[! unplaced segment|return f"**[00:00] [! unplaced segment|def=line
src/mikemol/audiostruct/render.py|segment-text-unstripped|record\.text\.strip\(\)|record.text|def=line
